              "content": "Retrieve ID and access tokens. This API is used to retrieve ID and access tokens using the code that was returned in the redirect URI as a query parameter (for example, when the user clicks a magic link). It may also create a new user if create_new_user was set to true in the send request and no user exists for the email address or phone number (depending on the flow).",
